						<macro id="1">wonderful</macro>
						<macro id="2">Meteorologists</macro>
					</macrodefinitions>
				</objectparameters>
				<title><image type="url" target="https://png.pngtree.com/png-vector/20190118/ourlarge/pngtree-cartoon-sun-smiling-sun-graffiti-smiling-sun-lovely-sun-png-image_461313.jpg"/>Today's Forecast</title>
				<body>
					<text>
						Important News <introduction />
						<p>Today will be the hottest day of the summer.</p>
						<p>Temperatures of about 41°C and no clouds will make it a <macro id="1"/> day for sun bathing in the afternoon...<speechbreak seconds="1"/></p>
						<p><macro id="2"/> advise people to stay at home at noon...</p>
					</text>
				</body>
			</message>
		</menuitem>

